WEBVTT

01:28.490 --> 01:35.050
Our Secret
EP16

01:36.760 --> 01:38.410
Astronomy Club.

01:41.480 --> 01:44.120
Welcome to Astronomy Club.

01:44.730 --> 01:46.370
Welcome to Astronomy Club.

01:49.970 --> 01:50.800
That one.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.800
Music Club sounds good.

01:55.200 --> 01:55.970
It's suitable for you.

01:56.329 --> 01:57.240
That's...

01:59.160 --> 01:59.930
Zhou Siyue

02:03.760 --> 02:05.370
Thank you for the application.

02:05.370 --> 02:07.120
I want to invite you to dinner when you are available.

02:07.880 --> 02:09.120
Come on. Can't let you pay.

02:09.250 --> 02:09.889
It's on me.

02:12.320 --> 02:13.930
I have to go, maybe another day.

02:16.370 --> 02:17.250
Comics Club.

02:21.600 --> 02:24.040
Here, welcome to Astronomy Club.

02:25.040 --> 02:26.810
Welcome to Astronomy Club.

02:28.370 --> 02:30.170
Calligraphy Club.

02:31.290 --> 02:32.600
Just join us!

02:41.370 --> 02:43.810
Excuse me, I can sign up for the Animation Club here?

02:43.929 --> 02:45.810
Yeah, do you wanna come in?

02:46.929 --> 02:47.560
Okay.

02:57.450 --> 02:57.960
Sit down, please.

02:58.810 --> 02:59.600
Ding Xian

03:00.120 --> 03:02.320
You have some drawing experience, right?

03:02.600 --> 03:03.890
Can you show us some previous works?

03:04.890 --> 03:06.960
Okay, here you are.

03:13.370 --> 03:14.810
You are the illustrator,

03:14.960 --> 03:15.650
The Little Monster?

03:18.560 --> 03:19.650
You know me?

03:20.250 --> 03:21.290
I know you for a long time.

03:21.929 --> 03:23.890
You are a gifted illustrator.

03:23.890 --> 03:24.929
It's a surprise for me to be in the same college with you.

03:25.480 --> 03:27.650
I thought you could be a student of an academy of fine arts.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.250
Thank you.

03:31.040 --> 03:33.560
In fact I'm an amateur.

03:33.840 --> 03:34.730
Be confident.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.890
The gift you have

03:37.010 --> 03:38.560
is more important than skills.

03:39.290 --> 03:42.650
Could you tell me

03:43.170 --> 03:45.400
is Zhou Siyue in this club?

03:46.040 --> 03:46.929
Zhou Siyue

03:47.960 --> 03:49.290
If you want to look for him,

03:49.600 --> 03:50.760
this isn't the right place.

03:51.600 --> 03:53.370
Siyue isn't our member,

03:53.560 --> 03:54.810
but a friend in another class.

03:55.600 --> 03:57.650
Comics Club is designing an application

03:57.650 --> 03:59.090
to show our works.

03:59.370 --> 04:00.560
He does a favour for us.

04:03.120 --> 04:03.930
I got it.

04:04.320 --> 04:05.120
Ding Xian

04:05.560 --> 04:06.890
Have you changed your mind?

04:07.560 --> 04:08.170
No.

04:09.450 --> 04:10.760
Come to our meeting on the next Monday.

04:11.040 --> 04:12.320
I'll add you to our group chat later.

04:12.400 --> 04:12.890
Okay.

04:16.890 --> 04:18.090
I found you!

04:18.280 --> 04:19.600
Why you didn't answer my call?

04:20.280 --> 04:21.200
I didn't hear it.

04:21.480 --> 04:23.480
Our counselor is looking for you.

04:23.970 --> 04:24.720
Counselor?

04:24.850 --> 04:25.530
Hurry up.

04:25.570 --> 04:27.130
I gotta go now, bye.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.160
Is the counselor here?

04:48.410 --> 04:49.720
I'm waiting for him.

04:50.160 --> 04:51.440
He hasn't been back yet.

04:54.200 --> 04:55.040
What's the matter with you?

04:56.810 --> 04:58.000
He wants to talk to me

04:59.090 --> 05:00.759
about that thing.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.930
He's kind.

05:08.440 --> 05:09.760
Don't worry.

05:21.600 --> 05:22.480
I have to go.

05:28.880 --> 05:31.200
It's so exaggerating.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.440
We aren't like Song Ziqi and you.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.280
Don't mention him.

05:35.440 --> 05:36.690
I'm angry with him.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.480
Still not reconciled?

05:38.810 --> 05:40.480
I've tried to bring up a topic,

05:40.480 --> 05:41.970
but he didn't reply.

05:41.970 --> 05:43.160
It has been days.

05:43.759 --> 05:45.200
Can you ask Siyue for me

05:45.690 --> 05:47.320
if possible?

05:47.759 --> 05:49.000
Okay, I will try

05:49.850 --> 05:52.160
though I myself haven't found the chance to talk to him.

05:52.720 --> 05:53.410
Seriously?

05:53.880 --> 05:56.250
Ban Jiayu, why did you have your hair done today?

05:57.570 --> 05:58.530
It's time to go!

06:00.759 --> 06:02.370
I'll hang up, Shasha.

06:02.530 --> 06:03.720
I have a party tonight.

06:03.850 --> 06:04.650
Okay.

06:04.970 --> 06:06.130
Hang up, bye.

06:06.130 --> 06:06.650
See you.

06:07.570 --> 06:08.040
Let's go.

06:09.760 --> 06:11.130
You go there in this suit?

06:12.850 --> 06:13.370
Why not?

06:14.720 --> 06:15.850
They are dull-colored.

06:17.570 --> 06:18.000
Really?

06:18.440 --> 06:19.160
I can wear another.

06:24.090 --> 06:25.200
We are here, come on!

06:25.200 --> 06:25.810
Come on!

06:26.410 --> 06:27.570
Here comes our news topic.

06:27.690 --> 06:29.570
You the Huaqing University for love?

06:33.600 --> 06:35.000
Disappointed?

06:35.000 --> 06:36.570
The one you go after is not here today.

06:39.650 --> 06:40.759
It's none of your business.

06:43.759 --> 06:44.850
Okay, all of us are here.

06:45.040 --> 06:45.690
Have a toast.

06:46.720 --> 06:47.440
Welcome our new members.

06:47.759 --> 06:49.720
Thank you.

06:55.280 --> 06:57.690
You've eaten too much.

06:57.850 --> 07:00.040
We have to come back home tomorrow.

07:00.600 --> 07:01.880
Have you finished?

07:02.880 --> 07:03.480
Let's play games.

07:03.530 --> 07:03.880
Okay.

07:03.880 --> 07:04.320
Good.

07:04.930 --> 07:07.160
Have you all played Truth or Dare?

07:07.280 --> 07:08.040
Yes.

07:08.480 --> 07:09.570
Okay, come on.

07:09.570 --> 07:10.130
Wow.

07:20.410 --> 07:21.930
Do you have questions?

07:21.930 --> 07:22.850
Any question for her?

07:25.810 --> 07:27.600
I have many questions for you.

07:28.970 --> 07:31.320
You went away with Zhou Siyue that day,

07:32.440 --> 07:33.600
and what happened after that?

07:40.000 --> 07:42.090
He took me to the playground

07:42.130 --> 07:43.880
and taught me a lesson.

07:44.650 --> 07:45.930
He told me how to

07:45.930 --> 07:47.280
get a first in every subject.

07:47.720 --> 07:49.160
This is Truth or Dare.

07:49.530 --> 07:50.480
You have to tell the truth.

07:50.880 --> 07:51.850
Please obey the rules.

07:51.850 --> 07:53.130
Agree.

07:54.090 --> 07:56.160
Okay, truth or dare.

07:56.160 --> 07:57.530
I choose the dare,

07:57.850 --> 07:59.410
so I don't have to tell the truth.

08:00.970 --> 08:02.760
Okay, it's up to you.

08:04.090 --> 08:06.600
Please do what you did

08:06.930 --> 08:09.160
in front of male dormitory.

08:09.410 --> 08:10.410
We've never seen such a big scene.

08:10.720 --> 08:11.600
Agree.

08:11.970 --> 08:13.650
You are so annoying.

08:15.970 --> 08:17.090
I don't think it's interesting.

08:17.320 --> 08:18.440
The video has been uploaded by others.

08:18.970 --> 08:20.160
If you want,

08:20.690 --> 08:22.410
you can find it online.

08:22.850 --> 08:24.370
Can we continue the game?

08:24.970 --> 08:27.370
Of course yes.

08:28.250 --> 08:29.480
Well,

08:31.570 --> 08:32.880
let me sing a song for you.

08:33.159 --> 08:33.840
That's great.

08:33.889 --> 08:36.370
That's good. Come on.

08:36.519 --> 08:37.769
Sing.

08:37.889 --> 08:39.330
Sing.

09:20.810 --> 09:22.250
You're a good singer.

09:26.520 --> 09:27.210
Zhou Siyue

09:28.840 --> 09:30.810
I want to study in Jiangling, too.

11:43.010 --> 11:44.520
Bravo.

11:50.520 --> 11:51.210
Okay.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.960
After the game and the song,

11:53.690 --> 11:55.370
do you want to order some other dishes?

11:55.520 --> 11:56.690
I'd like roast trotter.

11:57.250 --> 11:58.370
You're a good diner.

11:59.570 --> 12:00.130
Waiter

12:05.010 --> 12:05.520
Okay.

12:08.250 --> 12:08.890
What a coincidence.

12:09.720 --> 12:11.010
Zhou Siyue

12:11.810 --> 12:12.520
You

12:12.810 --> 12:13.960
are working here?

12:15.330 --> 12:16.160
Yes, a part-time job.

12:17.480 --> 12:18.720
I can help you order dishes.

12:19.130 --> 12:20.890
Here you are.

12:21.640 --> 12:23.040
Your prince charming

12:23.480 --> 12:26.130
looks like a poor childe.

12:26.810 --> 12:28.930
This restaurant is good. I planned to come here long before.

12:29.810 --> 12:30.400
It's pity

12:30.770 --> 12:31.810
that you are on duty

12:31.810 --> 12:32.810
or you can eat with us.

12:33.770 --> 12:34.330
It doesn't matter.

12:34.840 --> 12:37.080
There are signature dishes.

12:37.450 --> 12:39.010
The seafood is transported by air.

12:39.160 --> 12:40.160
Good for party.

12:40.450 --> 12:41.080
Do you like these?

12:42.160 --> 12:45.040
Okay, take your advice.

12:45.810 --> 12:46.250
Okay.

12:47.250 --> 12:49.130
Ask me

12:49.130 --> 12:49.930
if you need.

13:05.520 --> 13:07.160
Uncle Liu, let me do this.

13:08.010 --> 13:09.280
It's okay. I can do this.

13:11.330 --> 13:11.960
I'm sorry to ask you

13:12.040 --> 13:13.690
to change the shift with me.

13:14.370 --> 13:15.010
It doesn't matter.

13:15.480 --> 13:17.010
Come back and look after your kid,

13:17.250 --> 13:18.250
or he will fall sleep.

13:18.250 --> 13:18.890
Okay, thank you.

13:31.010 --> 13:31.810
Zhou Siyue

13:45.250 --> 13:46.130
Why are you still here?

13:51.570 --> 13:52.690
It's a return gift for your treat yesterday.

14:05.010 --> 14:05.810
Anything else?

14:11.960 --> 14:13.640
Did something happen to you?

14:15.010 --> 14:16.280
Nothing.

14:21.890 --> 14:24.130
My father isn't well recently,

14:24.400 --> 14:25.810
so my life is not what it used to be.

14:26.480 --> 14:27.960
I took a part-time job

14:28.080 --> 14:29.280
to help my parents.

14:29.840 --> 14:31.810
Are your parents all right?

14:32.480 --> 14:33.690
Can I help you?

14:33.690 --> 14:36.080
They are fine.

14:36.370 --> 14:37.040
Don't worry about us.

14:40.400 --> 14:42.040
They said you were going to the karaoke.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.720
You have to go now.

14:45.040 --> 14:46.280
You can't turn me away.

14:58.480 --> 14:59.210
Ding Xian

15:00.570 --> 15:01.770
I've told you

15:02.640 --> 15:04.810
that we have our own life.

15:05.770 --> 15:07.600
Now your university life begins. There are lots of

15:08.770 --> 15:10.040
interesting people and things.

15:10.960 --> 15:12.160
You should explore the new life,

15:17.600 --> 15:19.450
don't waste time on me.

15:20.770 --> 15:22.280
I also have a new life.

15:27.840 --> 15:29.210
Embracing a new life means

15:29.840 --> 15:31.690
forgetting the past, right?

15:40.130 --> 15:42.280
The past is the past.

15:53.960 --> 15:54.480
Okay,

15:57.040 --> 15:57.770
I got you.

16:29.480 --> 16:30.770
You finished?

16:31.040 --> 16:31.930
The manager is looking for you.

16:33.890 --> 16:34.450
I'm here.

16:39.570 --> 16:41.840
Here I am, manager.

16:42.520 --> 16:44.160
You wiped the table?

16:46.370 --> 16:47.280
I can tidy it up again.

16:47.600 --> 16:48.280
You don't have to.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.890
You are complained by a guest.

16:54.040 --> 16:55.400
I don't understand.

16:56.130 --> 16:57.210
The guest...

16:59.930 --> 17:01.080
Sometimes their complaints are

17:01.600 --> 17:03.130
totally unprovoked,

17:03.930 --> 17:06.449
but you have to understand me,

17:07.120 --> 17:09.449
catering business is depressed recently.

17:09.929 --> 17:11.689
And he topped up 10000 yuan in his VIP card.

17:14.000 --> 17:15.040
I cannot afford to offend him.

17:18.760 --> 17:20.160
I got it.

17:21.610 --> 17:22.240
Well,

17:23.160 --> 17:24.730
this is my last night here.

17:25.000 --> 17:25.969
I'll leave here tomorrow.

17:27.120 --> 17:27.929
Okay.

17:29.730 --> 17:30.730
Forgive me.

17:30.930 --> 17:31.880
Alright.

17:48.850 --> 17:50.280
Good for you.

17:50.330 --> 17:52.090
You are sweeping the post bar recently.

17:54.450 --> 17:55.970
Are they serious?

17:56.850 --> 17:58.330
These are rumors.

18:04.090 --> 18:04.850
Please,

18:05.090 --> 18:06.690
let me alone.

18:08.760 --> 18:09.400
Okay.

18:21.850 --> 18:23.330
Does someone know the story of

18:23.330 --> 18:25.280
Zhou Siyue, the one majors in computing?

18:25.520 --> 18:26.850
I don't know the details either.

18:27.240 --> 18:28.880
The department told us to keep quiet about it.

18:29.000 --> 18:30.330
It was dealt with in secret.

18:30.330 --> 18:32.090
Only one post left.

18:32.120 --> 18:32.930
You can read it.

18:52.810 --> 18:54.930
Don't judge him if you don't know him.

18:55.570 --> 18:56.850
What do you know about him?

18:57.280 --> 18:58.210
He's a...

19:02.880 --> 19:05.330
He's an excellent man.

19:20.640 --> 19:21.610
Siyue

19:24.610 --> 19:25.330
Come here.

19:26.880 --> 19:28.040
It's too late to have a meal.

19:29.570 --> 19:30.730
No appetite.

19:35.520 --> 19:37.760
Your dad is tired. He's asleep.

19:45.090 --> 19:46.160
My salary of this month.

19:47.400 --> 19:50.040
Why do you get it so early?

19:53.280 --> 19:54.810
It's for my good performance.

20:08.000 --> 20:09.850
You should save a little.

20:11.400 --> 20:13.360
Don't worry. I have scholarship.

20:13.690 --> 20:14.610
It's enough.

20:16.210 --> 20:18.880
You must be tired. You are thinner.

20:21.490 --> 20:22.730
It's not bad.

20:23.400 --> 20:25.280
I look great, right?

20:31.280 --> 20:33.000
Everything will be all right.

20:33.930 --> 20:34.640
Take it easy.

20:35.490 --> 20:36.640
Everything will be okay.

20:38.880 --> 20:39.760
It will be fine.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.160
Hey,

20:56.570 --> 20:57.760
wait for me.

21:00.240 --> 21:01.850
You studied all afternoon.

21:02.210 --> 21:03.240
You can't feel tired?

21:03.970 --> 21:05.610
A lazy man can't understand.

21:06.690 --> 21:07.400
Okay, you are right.

21:07.610 --> 21:10.330
Your GPA is 4.0. I can't compete with you.

21:13.930 --> 21:16.880
You see, there's a post about that girl again.

21:17.160 --> 21:18.120
She is so popular.

21:19.850 --> 21:20.970
You are mentioned, too.

21:21.570 --> 21:22.490
It's none of my business.

21:23.520 --> 21:24.210
Look at this!

21:25.610 --> 21:26.280
Come on.

21:27.240 --> 21:28.640
So beautiful, so sweet.

21:28.640 --> 21:30.610
If she were my girlfriend...

21:30.850 --> 21:31.850
Nice.

21:32.760 --> 21:34.280
It sounds perverted.

21:37.360 --> 21:38.760
The photo is good.

21:40.640 --> 21:41.880
It's taken in front of the bathhouse.

21:42.730 --> 21:43.760
A stalker?

21:48.520 --> 21:49.240
Oh!

21:49.570 --> 21:50.240
You never heard that

21:50.520 --> 21:51.810
a man pestered Xing Lufei

21:51.810 --> 21:53.090
and followed her everywhere

21:53.160 --> 21:54.690
last year.

21:55.330 --> 21:57.160
Then the matter was dropped. We don't know who he is.

21:58.570 --> 21:59.520
He returns to his old trade?

22:00.490 --> 22:01.280
Hey, where are you going?

22:01.280 --> 22:02.240
Back to the lab.

22:02.360 --> 22:03.850
You went there just hours ago!

22:34.120 --> 22:35.760
Yuan Fang the traitor.

22:46.360 --> 22:48.450
How dare you get out alone at night?

22:50.330 --> 22:52.280
You've met so many difficulties.

22:53.160 --> 22:54.520
Why not tell me?

23:00.930 --> 23:03.000
The new life you said

23:04.850 --> 23:06.210
is totally an excuse.

23:09.760 --> 23:12.520
You encouraged me to embrace a better future

23:16.520 --> 23:18.490
only because you were afraid.

23:20.450 --> 23:21.520
Just because of these things,

23:21.520 --> 23:23.570
you want to dump me.

23:27.490 --> 23:28.400
Ding Xian

23:31.610 --> 23:33.000
Have you ever thought over

23:33.000 --> 23:34.520
the relationship between us?

23:34.880 --> 23:37.330
Why should I think over?

23:38.690 --> 23:41.240
It's a simple thing.

23:46.690 --> 23:49.570
There may be some mistakes.

23:50.730 --> 23:52.730
Your friends used to be few.

23:55.120 --> 23:56.090
We two

23:57.040 --> 23:59.330
may be intimate when being deskmates,

24:00.930 --> 24:03.120
so you take our friendship as love.

24:14.610 --> 24:15.490
Four years.

24:17.730 --> 24:19.240
It's been four years, Zhou Siyue.

24:21.490 --> 24:23.570
You reckon that I don't know my own feeling?

24:25.610 --> 24:27.690
I've asked myself for numerous times

24:27.690 --> 24:29.280
if I really like you

24:30.240 --> 24:32.210
or it's just an illusion.

24:34.000 --> 24:35.090
If I can assure myself

24:35.090 --> 24:36.610
of a single thing in the world,

24:38.610 --> 24:40.400
that should be my love to you.

24:46.520 --> 24:47.690
Though you have many friends,

24:48.850 --> 24:50.810
are you sure that

24:50.810 --> 24:52.640
you regard me as a friend but not a lover?

24:59.160 --> 25:00.090
Yes, I am sure.

25:06.490 --> 25:07.850
I don't know you want to

25:07.850 --> 25:09.240
deceive me or yourself.

25:10.880 --> 25:13.090
We all know the truth.

25:17.280 --> 25:18.040
I have to go.

25:27.490 --> 25:28.240
So triggered.

25:29.120 --> 25:30.730
Always beat around the bush.

25:31.570 --> 25:33.280
Why not tell me your true thoughts?

25:36.160 --> 25:38.160
Ask me to figure things out.

25:38.690 --> 25:39.930
I do know my heart.

25:43.210 --> 25:44.000
It's annoying.

25:47.850 --> 25:48.610
In addition,

25:48.930 --> 25:50.120
don't take that tone with me!

25:50.610 --> 25:52.330
Mock at me and pull a face.

25:52.330 --> 25:53.810
Let me guess every day.

25:56.730 --> 25:57.520
Are you dumb?

25:58.120 --> 25:59.040
Speak!

26:04.160 --> 26:05.760
You orator.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.520
Now you are mute like timber!

26:11.570 --> 26:12.330
And you,

26:12.730 --> 26:13.520
don't look at me.

26:13.850 --> 26:15.450
Why are you looking at me?

26:15.610 --> 26:17.280
I'm not afraid of you!

26:30.360 --> 26:31.520
Sorry to be rude.

26:32.690 --> 26:33.400
Sorry.

27:09.240 --> 27:10.730
Will you feel too tired

27:11.240 --> 27:13.850
and depressed someday?

27:14.240 --> 27:15.360
What if

27:16.210 --> 27:17.610
that day comes?

27:18.280 --> 27:20.760
I'll help you in any case.

27:21.360 --> 27:22.730
I'll be there for you forever.

27:35.730 --> 27:36.930
Can you take me in?

27:41.330 --> 27:43.160
The boundless sky and endless earth may pass away,

27:43.360 --> 27:45.810
but his vows unfulfilled I'll never forgive.

27:46.210 --> 27:48.000
Men are liars.

27:49.240 --> 27:51.120
I might be crazy to

27:51.120 --> 27:53.330
tell him that.

27:53.690 --> 27:54.970
What should I do next time I meet him?

27:54.970 --> 27:56.610
I don't know what to say.

27:57.690 --> 27:59.360
Stop your complaints.

27:59.450 --> 28:01.360
At least you can see him,

28:01.690 --> 28:03.520
but I don't even know

28:03.520 --> 28:04.730
where Song Ziqi is.

28:05.930 --> 28:07.450
Our stories are tragic.

28:10.930 --> 28:11.810
Ding Xian

28:12.400 --> 28:13.610
I have an idea

28:13.850 --> 28:17.400
to help you and myself.

28:17.730 --> 28:19.880
Okay, I'm listening.

28:22.570 --> 28:23.970
Tell me, why did you move?

28:27.210 --> 28:30.210
I go to work and the hospital every day.

28:30.690 --> 28:32.520
Always come back at midnight

28:32.690 --> 28:33.640
and the gate of dormitory is closed.

28:34.520 --> 28:35.970
So I rent a house

28:35.970 --> 28:36.970
outside school.

28:46.280 --> 28:47.640
What happened to you?

28:49.880 --> 28:50.640
Fought with others.

28:52.640 --> 28:53.610
Me too.

28:55.400 --> 28:56.360
Got a demerit.

28:56.730 --> 28:57.690
Me too.

28:58.040 --> 28:58.880
I broke up with her.

29:00.690 --> 29:01.330
You see.

29:01.850 --> 29:03.280
I told you we were different.

29:03.730 --> 29:05.450
You two haven't been together seriously yet.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.160
You dare to say that?

29:09.610 --> 29:11.810
Do your parents know that?

29:12.160 --> 29:14.610
I told them and got a scolding from my mom.

29:15.330 --> 29:16.490
You know my dad.

29:17.520 --> 29:19.280
So here I am.

29:19.360 --> 29:20.210
Stay away from them.

29:23.040 --> 29:23.930
And what about Shadi?

29:29.330 --> 29:30.570
We broke up.

29:31.880 --> 29:33.210
Don't fool me.

29:34.160 --> 29:36.760
You've broken up for many times.

29:37.040 --> 29:37.880
It's not a joke.

29:39.090 --> 29:40.610
We are serious this time.

29:41.040 --> 29:42.400
She used to dump me,

29:43.400 --> 29:44.930
but I dumped her this time.

29:45.880 --> 29:47.240
That's my victory.

29:49.490 --> 29:50.360
Come on, don't fib.

29:51.760 --> 29:52.570
What can I do?

29:53.490 --> 29:55.000
I can't tell her these things.

29:55.850 --> 29:56.520
It's okay.

29:56.930 --> 29:58.490
She can find a better boy.

30:01.040 --> 30:02.280
How long do you intend to escape from her?

30:07.330 --> 30:08.880
As long as you will.

30:12.160 --> 30:13.040
Come on.

30:22.490 --> 30:25.160
At sight of injustice with a big roar.

30:25.360 --> 30:28.240
Do it when it's time to go.

30:28.400 --> 30:31.330
They'll make or break your heart and soul.

30:32.730 --> 30:33.810
Hey, hey, yo.

30:34.280 --> 30:35.570
Let me go.

30:36.810 --> 30:37.810
You can ask others.

30:39.850 --> 30:41.000
I want to ask you

30:41.160 --> 30:42.450
about the party

30:42.450 --> 30:43.330
of computing department.

30:45.520 --> 30:47.880
We freshmen want to invite some senior students

30:48.490 --> 30:50.160
to share your experience.

30:53.360 --> 30:54.880
I just want to ask your schedule.

30:54.880 --> 30:56.730
Since you are busy,

30:56.730 --> 30:57.570
I can...

30:57.760 --> 30:58.730
Wait.

30:59.490 --> 31:01.000
I didn't know what you wanted to ask.

31:01.160 --> 31:02.970
I'm free. I can go to the party.

31:03.120 --> 31:03.970
Really?

31:04.730 --> 31:06.610
If you are free,

31:06.690 --> 31:08.760
could you do me another favour?

31:11.490 --> 31:13.520
Many senior students

31:13.520 --> 31:15.090
wanna go to the party

31:15.090 --> 31:17.880
because of Ban Jiayu.

31:18.120 --> 31:20.880
If you want to join us...

31:22.490 --> 31:23.880
I got you.

31:24.360 --> 31:26.330
What can I help you? I'll do everything

31:26.330 --> 31:27.850
for you if I can.

31:34.360 --> 31:35.930
Okay, here he is.

31:39.450 --> 31:41.330
Why did he change the job?

31:41.970 --> 31:43.490
What's wrong with the restaurant?

31:43.880 --> 31:44.520
Don't mention it.

31:45.280 --> 31:46.610
Because of Dong Zhengfei and his gang.

31:47.090 --> 31:48.090
They just went there

31:48.400 --> 31:49.520
to embarrass him.

31:49.520 --> 31:50.120
to embarrass him.

31:50.850 --> 31:51.690
Dong failed

31:52.240 --> 31:53.160
and lost his temper with Siyue.

31:53.610 --> 31:54.880
He complained to the manager.

31:56.040 --> 31:56.930
It's not bad in fact.

31:57.490 --> 31:59.330
The restaurant is too far from our school.

31:59.760 --> 32:00.610
This one is closer.

32:01.610 --> 32:02.570
Now you arrive.

32:02.810 --> 32:03.810
Remember to add me in the group chat.

32:04.970 --> 32:06.160
Wait up.

32:06.160 --> 32:06.730
What's up?

32:06.970 --> 32:09.520
Could you bring him this?

32:10.090 --> 32:11.810
There are some dishes.

32:12.040 --> 32:14.690
No, he will know it if I go again.

32:15.090 --> 32:16.760
Please, you are so kind.

32:32.810 --> 32:33.610
Hey, man.

32:33.690 --> 32:34.570
Why are you here?

32:35.240 --> 32:37.850
I'm afraid that you're too busy to eat. Here is the meal.

32:38.690 --> 32:39.810
So kind of you.

32:40.490 --> 32:41.520
Yeah.

32:56.850 --> 32:59.240
Okay, you got it.

33:00.280 --> 33:02.810
She's too pitiful

33:03.040 --> 33:04.360
and I can't say no.

33:06.120 --> 33:07.400
But you,

33:08.400 --> 33:09.880
don't deny the tea between you two.

33:11.210 --> 33:13.210
You even know her handwriting.

33:14.400 --> 33:15.490
Is she coming here with you?

33:17.360 --> 33:18.280
She is waiting at the gate.

33:51.400 --> 33:52.810
Like taking photos?

33:54.880 --> 33:56.570
Never appear in front of me.

34:03.810 --> 34:04.760
Thank you.

34:05.400 --> 34:07.610
I didn't know he was tailing me

34:10.160 --> 34:11.049
Here you are.

34:13.489 --> 34:14.450
What's this?

34:17.319 --> 34:18.529
That's an alarm.

34:19.319 --> 34:20.970
Carry it all times to prevent harassment.

34:22.600 --> 34:24.009
You've known him for a long time?

34:30.970 --> 34:32.529
Don't send me away.

34:33.640 --> 34:35.160
I have something to ask you.

34:37.640 --> 34:38.690
Kong Shadi wants to ask you

34:38.690 --> 34:40.210
where's Song Ziqi.

34:46.210 --> 34:47.120
Really?

34:47.120 --> 34:48.770
You still have the mood to worry about others?

34:49.970 --> 34:51.839
You should worry about your own safety.

34:52.839 --> 34:54.730
Your photos are posted online

34:54.730 --> 34:56.450
but you never mind who takes them.

34:56.690 --> 34:58.120
Today he stalked you and took photos of you

34:58.120 --> 34:59.840
and he would do other things to you.

35:03.120 --> 35:04.400
I get it.

35:10.400 --> 35:11.320
Okay.

35:26.080 --> 35:26.880
Come back now.

35:33.080 --> 35:35.360
I'm afraid of being alone.

36:01.970 --> 36:02.970
Zhou Siyue

36:04.640 --> 36:05.490
What's up?

36:05.880 --> 36:06.880
I'm sure that

36:07.640 --> 36:08.730
you are concerned about me.

36:11.120 --> 36:12.400
You're so imaginative.

36:17.640 --> 36:19.400
Can we have a peaceful and frank talk.

36:19.800 --> 36:21.360
Now that you can't escape me,

36:21.640 --> 36:22.770
you can tell me your true thoughts.

36:42.530 --> 36:43.530
Just a moment. Thank you.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.050
I have to go back to work,

36:49.970 --> 36:50.840
so I will stop here.

36:53.450 --> 36:54.290
Okay,

36:54.930 --> 36:56.840
Lou Feng will come to me soon.

36:59.120 --> 37:00.080
Zhou Siyue

37:03.400 --> 37:05.800
why don't you tell me the truth?

37:09.450 --> 37:10.160
Ding Xian

37:13.210 --> 37:14.840
I'll study abroad in the next term.

37:27.010 --> 37:27.880
You'll go abroad?

37:32.490 --> 37:34.880
She entered Huaqing University for you.

37:36.560 --> 37:37.840
I don't mean to poke my nose into your affairs.

37:38.250 --> 37:39.290
As your friend

37:40.010 --> 37:41.530
I could see her efforts to go after you.

37:41.530 --> 37:42.930
Just feel that

37:43.120 --> 37:44.560
she's suffered a lot for you.

37:45.290 --> 37:47.880
I don't want her to go after me.

37:53.210 --> 37:54.160
Well, it's a pity

37:54.160 --> 37:56.250
if you let her go.

37:56.290 --> 37:58.360
You used to be intimate.

37:58.800 --> 38:00.290
If you let her get away, you'll regret.

38:01.530 --> 38:03.210
Try to imagine yourself in my shoes.

38:03.450 --> 38:04.930
I'm not eligible to

38:04.930 --> 38:06.210
start a relationship.

38:06.530 --> 38:07.530
It has nothing to do with

38:07.530 --> 38:08.840
eligibility.

38:08.880 --> 38:11.210
If you fall in love,

38:11.210 --> 38:12.690
why not be together?

38:12.730 --> 38:13.840
It’s easy to say that,

38:14.210 --> 38:15.770
but you are also here to escape your trouble.

38:16.800 --> 38:18.250
It's apples and oranges.

38:18.290 --> 38:19.600
Mine is a special case.

38:19.690 --> 38:21.050
No more excuses.

38:22.080 --> 38:23.840
Don't persuade me. You screwed it.

38:25.930 --> 38:26.770
Are you through?

38:27.690 --> 38:29.160
My words are all good for you.

38:29.800 --> 38:31.210
Just for your own good.

38:31.930 --> 38:33.490
What are you thinking?

38:33.490 --> 38:34.800
Why are you so irritable now?

38:34.970 --> 38:36.320
Then you can stop it.

38:36.320 --> 38:37.360
I don't want to talk about this.

38:37.730 --> 38:39.160
I'm triggered enough.

38:40.600 --> 38:42.320
Little Monster is braver than you.

38:42.320 --> 38:43.840
She never escapes from her feeling directly.

38:44.600 --> 38:45.450
And you don't escape?

38:45.880 --> 38:47.400
Then why are you here?

38:48.530 --> 38:49.210
Okay,

38:49.690 --> 38:50.450
you win.

38:51.050 --> 38:52.730
It's good for you to die alone.

39:20.450 --> 39:21.120
Ding Xian

39:21.530 --> 39:22.160
Ding Xian

39:23.690 --> 39:24.400
Come here.

39:28.930 --> 39:30.560
Please give it to Zhou Siyue.

39:31.970 --> 39:33.210
I give it to him?

39:33.770 --> 39:36.120
Yeah, we've asked his favour to

39:36.120 --> 39:37.210
make an application,

39:37.560 --> 39:39.050
and now it needs some changes.

39:40.320 --> 39:41.320
It's inconvenient for you?

40:04.840 --> 40:05.770
Why are you here?

40:10.160 --> 40:11.730
Our president asked me to send it.

40:13.930 --> 40:14.690
Okay.

40:15.730 --> 40:16.400
I got it.

40:18.400 --> 40:19.360
It's too late.

40:19.600 --> 40:20.450
You have to go back soon.

40:27.530 --> 40:29.120
I don't believe the excuse

40:32.080 --> 40:33.250
you gave me last night.

40:40.530 --> 40:41.450
And

40:41.880 --> 40:44.010
I'm not here to force you to date with me.

40:49.010 --> 40:49.800
I don't care.

40:53.400 --> 40:54.320
Zhou Siyue

40:57.010 --> 40:58.970
We love each other.

41:01.160 --> 41:01.970
As I see,

41:01.970 --> 41:04.450
there's no simpler thing than it.

41:08.880 --> 41:11.010
I'll always be with you

41:12.450 --> 41:14.160
no matter how many times you refuse me.

41:17.530 --> 41:18.770
It's my promise.

41:53.930 --> 41:55.840
I found a good fortunetelling book. Let me see yours.

41:59.450 --> 42:02.730
This month is not suitable to start a relationship.

42:03.400 --> 42:05.600
You'd better bide your time

42:05.970 --> 42:09.050
or you'll meet your Waterloo.

42:09.600 --> 42:12.210
Xianxian, or you sit tight.

42:12.840 --> 42:15.160
Haste makes waste.

42:15.730 --> 42:17.050
Stop your nonsense.

42:17.450 --> 42:18.490
I won't help you two

42:19.320 --> 42:20.880
if you talk rubbish again.

42:21.360 --> 42:24.210
Hey, that's not my fault.

42:24.210 --> 42:25.690
The book tells me.

42:26.770 --> 42:29.840
The research group

42:30.120 --> 42:31.530
sounds hard to get in.

42:31.770 --> 42:33.970
Don't to mention the opportunities to go abroad.

42:35.600 --> 42:36.970
I know it's difficult,

42:37.930 --> 42:38.840
but

42:40.290 --> 42:42.210
I can't leave him alone.

42:44.050 --> 42:45.690
He has had many troubles.

42:46.730 --> 42:49.120
I want to make up for my absence in his difficulties.

42:50.320 --> 42:52.490
I can't part with him for these reasons.

42:55.160 --> 42:57.210
What's more, I can make it.

42:58.010 --> 42:59.320
I'll show him my determination.

42:59.690 --> 43:01.400
God doesn't help me

43:02.050 --> 43:03.290
but I can help myself.

43:09.930 --> 43:11.010
Thank you, sir.

43:17.080 --> 43:18.730
This is a freshman.

43:19.250 --> 43:20.050
Siyue

43:21.050 --> 43:22.210
She's from your senior high school.

43:22.600 --> 43:23.560
Do you know her?

43:25.210 --> 43:25.930
The next one.

43:35.250 --> 43:36.120
Hello,

43:36.360 --> 43:38.490
I'm a freshman majoring in computing.

43:38.490 --> 43:39.600
I'm Ding Xian.

43:43.840 --> 43:44.730
Why are you laughing?

43:45.600 --> 43:46.600
Anything interesting?

43:49.640 --> 43:51.250
Why do you want to join us?

43:52.490 --> 43:53.400
I...

44:10.530 --> 44:11.320
Ding Xian

44:16.400 --> 44:17.600
What do you want to do?

44:19.450 --> 44:21.400
I want to go abroad with you.

44:21.770 --> 44:23.840
It's not as easy as you thought.

44:24.360 --> 44:26.320
You would give up many things for it.

44:27.360 --> 44:28.840
You're in the Comics Club.

44:29.640 --> 44:30.840
Do you have enough time to do it?

44:31.210 --> 44:32.490
I can do it.

44:33.450 --> 44:35.120
I'll put much time on it.

44:36.490 --> 44:38.530
You and drawing are both my pursuit.

44:45.320 --> 44:46.770
I'm wondering that

44:49.320 --> 44:52.160
what's your reason to major in computing

44:52.930 --> 44:54.730
though you don't like it?

44:56.690 --> 44:58.560
It's for...

44:58.930 --> 44:59.880
For me.

45:09.080 --> 45:11.640
You've struggled for one year

45:13.080 --> 45:15.450
to gain admission to Huaqing University.

45:17.490 --> 45:19.600
Don't do what you don't like to.

45:23.640 --> 45:25.530
I hope you can think it twice

45:26.560 --> 45:28.690
before you make every decision.

45:29.730 --> 45:31.640
Think of what you like.

45:32.290 --> 45:33.690
I've thought it over.

45:35.730 --> 45:38.080
I've said that I couldn't give you up.

45:38.880 --> 45:40.320
If your reason is going abroad,

45:40.320 --> 45:41.930
I'll go with you.

45:43.050 --> 45:44.880
I can deal with everything for you.

45:45.400 --> 45:46.210
Never mind.

45:51.080 --> 45:53.320
You don't think I can pass the entrance test?

45:53.640 --> 45:56.360
I've never worried about your test.

45:57.080 --> 45:58.970
I know you can do everything

45:59.320 --> 46:00.730
if you want to.

46:02.690 --> 46:05.490
It's no small matter.

46:06.970 --> 46:08.600
As long as you're in the scientific research group,

46:08.880 --> 46:10.450
I won't regret my choice.

46:11.530 --> 46:12.770
I can make it.

46:13.080 --> 46:14.080
Trust me.

46:19.730 --> 46:21.450
So stubborn.
